# tests/squash-stack, as an ENTRY: evaluating this directory yields the test's
# ARG TREE, which dev/run-test then runs.
#
# A WORKER TEST, like tests/merge: std/squash-stack is the subject, and the
# fixture commits are minted with `caos put-commit`, so no client is needed.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/go --worker1:@=worker.go --squash:@=DEEP-DEPS/squash-stack
